.aider*

# KIAO-installed format skills: worker writes the reference/kiao-skills bundle into the
# store's .agents/skills and .claude/skills at every start. When this checkout is the store, those
# are generated copies — only verify, hexarch, markdown-anchors, dashboard-plugin and file-actions
# are this tree's own. All but verify have a discovery entry in both directories;
# verify lives in .agents/skills alone, read by path from AGENTS.md.
.agents/skills/*
!.agents/skills/README.md
!.agents/skills/verify/
!.agents/skills/hexarch/
!.agents/skills/markdown-anchors/
!.agents/skills/dashboard-plugin/
!.agents/skills/file-actions/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/dashboard-plugin/
!.claude/skills/file-actions/
!.claude/skills/hexarch/
!.claude/skills/markdown-anchors/
